‡O plethusmos tes Ges ekhei apodekatistei apo kapoia ergasteriaka kataskeuasmene pandemia. Ekhoun epibiosei mono mia mikre omada anthropon kai oi Kreikanthropoi me ta prasina matia -kalokagatha anthropoeide pou demiourgese o Kreik gia n' antikatastesei tous anthropous. E Tompi, kapote melos ton Kepouron tou Theou kai eidike sta manitaria kai stis melisses, einai eroteumene me ton Zemp, o opoios ekhei endiapheron parelthon. Mazi me ton prophete ton paidion tou Kreik, ton Khionanthropo-ton-Tzimi, ten Amanta, ton Druokolapte, ten Ponere Alepou kai tous upoloipous Phrikoplastous, idiophueis bio-epistemones, paleuoun na epibiosoun kai na sothoun ap' ten epithese ton mokhtheron Ponosphairiston kai ton organokhoiron, diagenetikon gourounion me anthropina organa.
Me pneumatode diathese, asteireute phantasia kai skoteino khioumor, e brabeumene me Booker Margkaret Atgount mas paradidei to aproblepto, tromaktiko, alla tautokhrona xekardistiko To Telos tou Kosmou -ton sugkinetiko kai dramatiko epilogo tes emblematikes trilogias."Œ
‰From the author of the bestselling Gould's Book of Fish, The Sound of One Hand Clapping and The Unknown Terrorist comes a haunting meditation on love, loss and the way life is finally determined never by reason, but only ever by wanting.
In 19th-century Van Diemen's Land, a young Aboriginal girl, Mathinna, is adopted by the celebrated explorer Sir John Franklin and his wife, Lady Jane, to show that the savage can be civilized. Lady Jane believes the distance between savagery and civilization is the learned capacity to control wanting. The experiment fails, and Sir John disappears into the blue ice of the Arctic, seeking the Northwest Passage. A decade later, Lady Jane enlists Charles Dickens' aid to put an end to the scandalous suggestions that Sir John's expedition ended in cannibalism.
Wanting
confirms Richard Flanagan's growing reputation as one of our most original and powerful novelists."Œ

‰
Ta dodeka diegemata tou Mpris Nt' Tz. Pankeik apotuponoun aristotekhnika to aphiloxeno phusiko periballon kai tis antixootetes tes zoes ste geneteira tou, te Dutike Birtzinia. Oi eroes tou einai agrotes, anthrakorukhoi, xepesmenoi pugmakhoi, neoi pou asphuktioun sten upaithro, anthropoi egklobismenoi pou xespoun se praxeis tuphles bias. O melagkholikos kosmos tou apodidetai me lite kai kophte glossa, pou sukhna dianthizetai me lurismo kai sarkastiko khioumor.
"O Pankeik gennetheke to 1952 kai autoktonese to 1979, se elikia eikosi epta eton. E autoktonia tou anekopse proora mia suggraphike poreia pou anamenotan lampre. Ostoso, kai mono ta dodeka diegemata pou prolabe na oloklerosei kai perilambanontai sto ana kheiras biblio arkoun oste semera na theoreitai "enas apo tous pente kaluterous diegematographous ton teleutaion penenta eton" (Guardian)
"O kaluteros, o pio authentikos suggrapheas pou diabasa pote." (Kurt Vonnegut)
"Enas exairetika talantoukhos nearos suggrapheas, pou mpainei kaneis ston peirasmo na sugkrinei to ntempouto tou me to ntempouto tou Khemingouei." (Joyce Carol Oates)
"E graphe tou Pankeik einai monadike: trakhia, dektike, boutegmene sten ome pragmatikoteta. Einai mia graphe asthmainousa, pou menei kharagmene sto mualo tou anagnoste." (Margaret Atwood)"‘
Poios etan o Alexios Komnenos pou tha polemouse se Anatole kai Duse gia na sosei to Buzantio apo to kheilos tou gkremou; Poies gunaikes ton agapesan; Poios prospathouse na ton deleteriasei; Giati e thugatera tou, e Anna Komnene, misouse ton aderpho tes, to sunautokratora Ioanne; Giati e gunaika tou, e Eirene Douka, proothouse to Nikephoro Bruennio sto throno; Anthropoi kai gegonota, apotukhies, dakrua kai kaemoi, elpides, oramata pou esbesan, khares pou exanemistekan, mikrotetes kai pathe. To muthistorema "Enas skouphos apo porphura" philodoxei na zontanepsei ten teleutaia analampe tou Buzantiou kai na mas taxidepsei s' ekeina ta duskola khronia, mesa apo ten aphegese enos asemou palatianou, pou aposurmenos ste Sinope tou Pontou, xanathumatai, empleos deous, ta perasmena."™
–E amerikanida Merilin Rompinson, mia apo tis semantikoteres suggrapheis tes epokhes mas, mas kharizei ten axekhaste istoria enelikioses enos koritsiou pou megalonei sto perithorio tes koinonias mes ston phobo kai to deos, ta khronia tes megales upheses tes amerikanikes oikonomias te dekaetia tou 1920. E Laila, astege kai mone, aphou ekhei periplanethei epi khronia sten upaithro, mpainei sten ekklesia mias mikres poles tes Aioba gia na brei kataphugio apo te brokhe. Aute tha einai e aphorme gia na gennethoun enas erotas kai mia anazetese pou tha tes allaxoun te zoe. Aphou pantreutei ton ierea tes ekklesias kai brethei se asphales kai prostateumeno periballon, tha xekinesei na anazeta to noema ton duskolon khronon tes uparxes tes.
Ena biblio gia ton erota pou erkhetai otan pia se ekhei semadepsei e zoe, ena biblio gia ten piste, alla kai gia ola auta pou den mporoun na ekphrastoun me lexeis, oso bathia ki an ta niothoume.
a brei kataphugio apo te brokhe. Aute tha einai e aphorme gia na gennethoun enas erotas kai mia anazetese pou tha tes allaxoun te zoe. Aphou pantreutei ton ierea tes ekklesias kai brethei se asphales kai prostateumeno periballon, tha xekinesei na anazeta to noema ton duskolon khronon tes uparxes tes.
Ena biblio gia ton erota pou erkhetai otan pia se ekhei semadepsei e zoe, ena biblio gia ten piste, alla kai gia ola auta pou den mporoun na ekphrastoun me lexeis, oso bathia ki an ta niothoume."
šKategoroumenos gia katokhe narkotikon kai prophulakismenos sten Mpangkok, o Manouel Manrike, Kolombianos phoitetes philosophias, kinduneuei na katadikastei se thanato, an den paradekhtei sto dikasterio ten enokhe tou. Tha empisteutei ten istoria tou ston proxeno tes Kolombias pou ekhei analabei na kheiristei ten upothese tou, tha tou exomologethei te monakhike zoe tou kai te phuge apo ten abastakhte kathemerinoteta mesa apo te logotekhnia kai ton kinematographo, pou tou apokaluptoun oti uparkhoun ki alloi anthropoi san ki auton, <>.
To mono prosopo pou agapese o Manouel, e adelphe tou Khouana, exaphanisteke prin apo tessera khronia, ki ekeinos, akolouthontas ta ikhne tes, perase apo ten Mpangkok me teliko proorismo to Tokio, opou ekhei mathei oti zei mplegmene se ena kukloma porneias. Osa agnoei o Manouel tha ta aphegethei e adelphe tou, eno o proxenos, sugklonismenos apo ten peripeteia tes zoes tous, einai e trite phone tes aphegeses. <>, delonei o romantikos Manouel, katoikos ton oneiron, pou, opos kai e kunike pragmatistria Khouana, tha sugkroustei me dunameis pio iskhures apo ton idio.
Telika, auto to muthistorema einai kai astunomiko kai istoria agapes pou enonei duo adelphia. Kai politike kataggelia tou kathestotos tes Kolombias, kai poietike proseggise. Me logotekhnikes kai kinematographikes anaphores, me diadromes anamesa sten Mpogkota, to Delkhi, ten Mpangkok, to Tokio kai ten Tekherane. Milontas gia ten agape, ten odune, ten exegerse, te bia, te monaxia, ton phobo, ten enokhe. Me ena orama os to telos aplesiasto: <>(A. Rempo)." 
Aute einai e istoria duo orphanon aderphon pou megalonoun se mia mikre pole khamene mes sten aperantosune tes Boreiodutikes Amerikes, opos ten aphegeitai e mia ek ton duo, e Routh, ena melagkholiko kai oneiropolo koritsi, anemporo na pistepsei se kati monimotero apo mia stigme, mia thumese e ena oneiro. Ekhontas biosei ten egkataleipse apo mia seira apo suggeneis, e Routh kai e Lousil katalegoun ste phrontida tes Sulbi, tes apomakres kai ainigmatikes aderphes tes meteras tous kai agonizontai na enelikiothoun semademenes apo ten apoleia kai te monaxia. E poreia tous kathrephtizetai stis uperokhes eikones apo to pagomeno phusiko topio pou tis periballei s' ena sugkhrono muthistorema pou ede apo ten ekdose tou khairetisteke os klasiko.
Mia aristourgematika lurike aphegese me epikentro osous den katapheran na sundethoun pote me enan topo, enan skopo, mia kathemerinoteta e enan allo anthropo. gia osous zoun xekhasmenoi apo ten istoria prospathontas na epheuroun mia zoe khoris opoiadepote sterixe.
Klasiko. San seirena e Rompinson se trabaei ston apatela reusto, uperokha phtiagmeno parallelo kosmo tes. [Guardian]
Niotheis ten kathelotike apeleutherose sussoreumenes suggraphikes autopepoitheses, ten eukhariste ekplexe apenanti stis aprosdoketes dunatotetes tes glossas, mia prosektike alla bathia agape gia tous anthropous pou nomizame pos mono oi agioi mporoun na aisthanthoun. [New York Times ]
Epiasa ton eauto mou na diabazei olo kai pio arga. Den einai biblio pou prepei na diabastei biastika. Kathe protase einai alethine apolause. [Doris Lessing]"¥
¢Ena oloklero sumpan asulleptes ki apateles omorphias apo ton spoudaiotero Iapona muthistoriographo.
E gata tou Torou Okanta exaphanizetai ki auto anastatonei te gunaika tou, pou ginetai olo kai pio apomakre.
Ustera arkhizei mia seira apo musteriode telephonemata. Kai kathos xetuligetai aute e sunarpastike istoria, e aple, metremene kai kapos aniare zoe tou Okanta (o opoios mageireuei, diabazei, akouei tzaz kai opera kai pinei mpira sto trapezi tes kouzinas tou) erkhetai ta pano kato, kai xekinaei ena allokoto taxidi me aphaneis odegous diaphorous paraxenous anthropous, pou o kathenas ekhei na diegethei kai mia istoria.
O Mourakami graphei gia te sugkhrone Iaponia kai to semerino kosmo, gia ten apoxenose stis poleis kai ta taxidia autognosias, kai s auto to biblio, sunduazontas anamneseis apo ton polemo me metaphusikes anesukhies, oneira kai paraistheseis, uphainei ena oloklero sumpan asulleptes ki apateles omorphias."¥
¢Ena sugkhrono aristourgeua apo ten pio deuophile Italida suggraphea tes epokhes uas. E "Uperokhe phile uou", to proto biblio tes Tetralogias tes Napoles, einai e istoria tes Elenas kai tes Lilas, uia istoria pou xekina te dekaetia tou '50 ue phonto uia phtokhogeitonia tes Napoles. E suggrapheas kataduetai sten periploke phuse tes philias ton duo koritsion pou apo ephebes ginontai gunaikes, akolouthontas beua beua ten exelixe katheuias xekhorista, ton tropo pou e uia epereazei ten alle, ta sunaistheuata pou ana tis dekaeties tis boethoun na khtisoun uia ousiastike, aklonete skhese. Me aparauillo stil kai apsegadiaste, skholastike uatia e Pherrante se uia kathelotike aphegese xediplonei uesa apo ten istoria uias philias ten istoria uias geitonias, uias poles ki entelei enos ethnous pou bionei kosuoistorikes allages ue to perasua ton dekaetion.
