O Khares, meselikas suggrapheas, kataphernei na apodrasei sto Parisi ligo prin apo ten Krise. Piso tou, e Ellada paradidetai stis phloges tou phasismou. Meta to Okhi sto demopsephisma tou 2011, to praxikopema ton Pente Emeron kai ten analepse tes exousias apo ton Ena, e Athena moiazei me zougkla, eno e upaithros den ekhei trekhoumeno nero, reuma, phageto. E kore tou Khare phtanei misopethamene sto spiti tou pappou tes, s' ena oreino khorio. Otan tha anagkastoun na egkataleipsoun to spiti tous kai na bgoun sto dromo, einai e stigme pou tha tethei se epharmoge to Skhedio. Gia na anatrapoun ola.
Ena muthistorema pou diereuna tis anthropines skheseis mesa se ena periballon apomonoses kai kleistophobias, pou proseggizei ta prosopa tes aphegeses me akribeia kheirourgou, pou thetei, telos, tous polites pro ton euthunon tous apenanti ston tromo tou oloklerotismou.
En oligois, ena monadiko psukhologiko kai politiko thriler."ª
§"An arnetheis na me pistepseis, tha papso na se theoro gio mou..."
Mekhri tora o Ntaniel pisteue oti meta te suntaxiodotese tous oi goneis tou aposurthekan se mia apomakrusmene pharma ste Souedia, te khora katagoges tes meteras tou, gia na apolausoun mia esukhe zoe. Ena telephonema, omos, erkhetai na anatrepsei ta panta.
"E metera sou... den einai kala" tou leei o pateras tou. "Phantazetai diaphora apaisia, tromera pragmata".
Ligo prin o Ntaniel epibibastei sten ptese gia te Souedia, dekhetai ena telephonema apo te metera tou: "O, ti sou ekhei pei autos o anthropos einai psema. Den eimai trele... Prepei na pao sten astunomia... Sunantese me sto Khithroou".
Ap' te mia stigme sten alle o Ntaniel brisketai dikhasmenos anamesa stous goneis tou - poion ap' tous duo na pistepsei, poion na empisteutei; Athela tou ginetai exomologetes kai krites tes meteras tou. Akroates enos phriktou egklematos, mias sunomosias sten opoia empleketai o idios tou o pateras, o Ntaniel prepei na exetasei ta stoikheia kai na apophasisei: Poios leei ten aletheia;
Sto kathelotiko kai aristotekhnika domemeno muthistorema tou, o Tom Romp Smith sunthetei mia koinoteta, mia oikogeneia, enan gamo ki ena mualo pou briskontai se bathia krise kai apotuponei me aparamillo tropo ten euthrauste skhese anamesa se mia metera kai ston gio tes. Me to Paidi 44 o Tom Romp Smith eiselthe dunamika ston logotekhniko kharte* me te Pharma edraionei te these tou anamesa stous pio prototupous kai kharismatikous suggrapheis tes genias tou. (Apo ten parousiase sto opisthophullo tou bibliou)
"Sumbainei kapoies spanies phores enas suggrapheas na katorthonei, san ripsokindunos isorropistes, na grapsei ena astunomiko muthistorema pou uperbainei ta stena oria tou eidous. Mia tetoia periptose einai kai e Pharma". (Tzephru Ntiber, suggrapheas tou Sullektes oston)"¯
¬To psarema einai e apolute eleutheria. Na pegaineis pano-kato, perimenontas to psari na tsimpesei kai na xedipsas stis peges. Na eisai entelos monos gia mia ora, gia liges meres, gia liges ebdomades, einai auto pou panta apozetousa ste zoe... Na ti pisteuo pos einai eleutheria.
...........................................................................................
Ena 10khrono agori analambanei ten euthune tes oikogeneias tou, otan o pateras kai t' adelphia tou stelnontai se stratopeda sugkentroses kata te diarkeia tes germanikes katokhes sten Tsekhoslobakia. Kunegaei kai psareuei kai phrontizei ten akribe tou mana.
San eleuthero pouli, opos ekeino to kheli sto diegema "O megas aletes ton udaton", pou xeglistraei apo ta desma tou gia na kataphugei sten eleutheria tou potamou, etsi ki o mikros Ota Pabel, san enas allos Tom Soger tes Kentrikes Europes trekhei pano-kato se potamia, limnes kai libadia, giati biazetai na megalosei kai na apodrasei apo mia duskole epokhe pou pernouse e Europe kai pou ta semadia deikhnane pos den tha etane ki e teleutaia."²
¯Posa ospria mporei na phaei kapoios -akoma ki ep' apeile Grexit- khoris na riskarei te skhese tou; Pos ginetai to rabani na periekhei ta dodeka auga pou upagoreuei e suntage khoris to teliko apotelesma na murizei san kati pou mas aphese khronous; Mporei mia spanakopita na se glitosei ap' te kholera; Kai ti mporeis na kaneis entos tou plaisiou tou nomou otan mia philesukhe geitonissa pesei thuma lukanthropismou;
Auta kai alla agoniode erotemata apantontai me tropo spartaristo s' ena bibliaraki pou agapetheke kai pakhune me kainouries istories kai pou xemutizei pali me exophullo dia kheiros tou megistou Arka - mia ki o "Ser" Karkharias einai to mono plasma pou e adephagia tou mporei na sugkrithei m' auten tou allotinou eautou tou suggraphea.
Agape olouthe! (Apo ten parousiase sto opisthophullo tou bibliou)"µ
²Eno o Markos Mpardas kai o Sephes Sourodes diabazoun Oikonometria - to teleutaio mathema tou ptukhiou - ta phlas mpak pephtoun to ena piso apo to allo kai to paron ginetai xana photeino, me gunaikes, giagiades kai paraxenes geographies. Oi duo philoi tha zesoun ekato phores te zoe tous, opos sumbainei to bradu tes protokhronias, tha sullaboun to noema ton diakopon, tha katanoesoun te skhese paidikes summorias kai politikes strateuses kai tha suzetesoun me upomone to problema tes ikanotetas ton koritsion na theloun panta kati perissotero apo auto pou khreiazontai. To kalokairi tha arkhisei san oiko-nometriko upodeigma kai tha teleiosei se apolute sugkhuse me te gramme tou orizontos."¸	
µ	Barkelone, 1957. O Ntaniel kai e Mpea, oi eroes tou bibliou "E skia tou anemou", ekhoun pantreutei, ekhoun apoktesei ena gio kai zoun me ton patera tou Ntaniel sto bibliopoleio Sempere & Uioi. O Phermin ergazetai akome mazi tous kai etoimazetai gia to gamo tou me ten Mpernarnta. Phainetai omos oti kati ton apaskholei.
O Ntaniel einai monos tou sto magazi otan ena proi mpainei mesa enas musteriodes antras pou koutsainei. Entopizei ena polutimo biblio pou phulassetai se bitrina, mia monadike eikonographemene ekdose tou Kome tou Monte Kristo. Para to gegonos oti o xenos de phainetai na endiapheretai gia biblia, thelei na agorasei aute ten akribe ekdose. Kai pros megale ekplexe tou Ntaniel, e prote tou kinese einai na grapsei pano sto biblio tis lexeis: "Ston Phermin Romero nte Tores, pou gurise apo tous nekrous kai pou krata to kleidi gia to mellon". Etsi xetuligetai mia istoria prodosias pou sematodotei ten epistrophe enos thanasimou ekhthrou.
To trito biblio ston kuklo ton muthistorematon pou xekinese me te "Skia tou anemou" kai "To paikhnidi tou aggelou" metapherei kai pali ton anagnoste ston kosmo tou Koimeteriou ton Lesmonemenon Biblion kai sto musteriodes bibliopoleio Sempere & Uioi."¿
¼O Astragalos -sten pragmatikoteta "To katagma ston astragalo"- einai to khroniko mias apodrases apo tis gunaikeies phulakes kai mia istoria epibioses. Somatikos kai psukhikos ponos, suntrophikoteta, sunenokhe, sunomotikoteta, erotas, prodosia: ena autobiographiko muthistorema, opou e anamone moiazei me paralerema. To biblio egine muthos ste dekaetia tou '60 - okhi mono gia ten perigraphe mias zoes sto perithorio, alla kai gia te glossa, gia te khare tou uphous. E Almpertin Sarrazen theoretheke o thelukos Zan Zene, apespase exaisies kritikes, apo ton Nouvel Observateur mekhri tis khristianikes ephemerides, kai to 1968 egine eroida kinematographikes tainias me protagonistes te Marlen Zomper kai ton Khorst Mpoukholts. Mia kainouria diaskeue tou bibliou probletheke ton Aprilio tou 2015 me protagonistria te Leila Mpekhti."Ç
ÄO Elias, enas anthropos pou ekhei khasei ta panta -douleia, oikogeneia-, sta penenta tria tou khronia pheugei apo ten Athena kai epistrephei sto khorio tou, to Delbinaki psela sto Pogoni, sta ellenoalbanika sunora. Otan mia neare gunaika brisketai banausa dolophonemene exo apo to khorio, e exikhniase tou phonou ginetai gia ton eroa emmone idea, enas skopos pou gemizei to psukhiko tou keno kai ton adeio khrono.
Me phonto to kheimoniatiko topio tes oreines Epeirou, pou aphenei to apotupoma tou ste lite, adra poietike glossa, sto aperitto uphos tes aphegeses, alla kai sto ethos ton kharakteron, xetuligetai o mitos mias istorias philias kai prodosias pou katalegei ste lutrose me ton erkhomo tes anoixes."Î
ËTo biblio xekina me ena seismo, idomeno mesa apo ta matia enos anonumou enniakhronou agoriou pou zei se ena mesoastiko sugkrotema katoikion sto Maipu, tes Khiles. Sto deutero meros, protagonistes einai o suggrapheas tou protou merous tou muthistorematos. O pateras tou einai enas ligomiletos anthropos, o opoios eno iskhurizetai oti den endiapheretai gia ten politike, siopela suntassetai me to kathestos Pinoset.
E aphegese enallassetai anamesa ston suggraphea kai ton protagoniste, to parelthon kai to paron, proballontas me melagkholia kai orge ten istoria enos ethnous, kai mias genias -pou opos leei o suggrapheas emathe na diabazei kai na graphei enoso oi goneis tous eginan sunergoi e thumata tes Diktatorias.
Prokeitai gia to pio prosopiko muthistorema tou Alejandro Zambra (suggraphea tou <>), pou einai isos o semantikoteros Khilianos suggrapheas meta ton Roberto Bolano.
<<...Mia phora, khatheka. Tha 'moun exi e epta khronon. Eikha aphairethei kai, xaphnika, den eblepa pia tous goneis mou. Phobetheka, alla breka amesos to dromo ki ephtasa protos sto spiti - ekeinoi m' epsakhnan sunekheia, apegnosmena, alla ego nomisa oti eikhan khathei* oti ego exera na gurizo spiti ki ekeinoi okhi. <>eipe e metera mou argotera, me ta matia tes akoma klammena. <>skephteka, alla den to eipa...>>graphei o Zambra sto biblio kai o metaphrastes Akhilleas Kuriakides semeionei:
To eipe, argotera, o Alejandro Zambra, graphontas auto to thaumasio muthistorema anapoleses tes paidikes elikias, tes khamenes athootetas kai ton enokhon gia ten apoleia tes athootetas. E ennoia tes apoleias kuriarkhei sten aphegese, ten aphegese tes peripeteias mias aenaes, noeres epistrophes, opou ta psikhoula tou Kontorebuthoule ekhoun phagothei pro pollou..."Ø
ÕIn this sequel to The Storm Whale, the boy, Noi, is caught in a storm at sea and his whale friend comes to his rescue.
When Noi's dad sails out on one last fishing trip before winter, Noi waits for him at home. But as the storm worsens and his dad does not return, Noi decides to go looking for his dad. But the storm is powerful and dangerous, and soon Noi, too, is stuck in the icy sea. When it seems that all hope is lost, a friend comes to help Noi and his father. Poignant and evocative, this is a beautiful celebration of friendship and family, and the special bond between a father and son."à
İ<>Noiotho oti apodunamonomai, klerike. Aphese tis prokatalepseis sou, gine antras, gine anthropinos, dikhos phobo kai prosdokia* aphese exo tous theous kai tis threskeies sou: ola auta einai gia na oplizoun to kheri ton anthropon* kai mono sto onoma auton ton phrikaleoteton khutheke perissotero aima ste ge apo olous tous allous polemous kai tis mastiges mazi. Aparnesou ten idea enos allou kosmou, den uparkhei* men aparnetheis omos ten apolause tes eutukhias kai ten ulopoiese tes. Autos einai o monos tropos pou sou prospherei e phuse gia na zeugaroseis ten uparxe sou e na ten exaploseis... Phile mou, e edone uperxe pantote to polutimotero agatho mou* se ole mou te zoe tes anaba kanteli, tora thelo ego na sbeso sta kheria tes...>>
Enas ieromenos prospathei mataia na sosei ten psukhe enos etoimothanatou ten eskhate stigme. Enas suntomos paigniodes dialogos pou perikleiei tis kentrikes apopseis gia te zoe, te threskeia kai tis edones tou <>Markesiou, tou <>, kata ton Apollinair."å
âEna egkataleimmeno paidi...
Tis paramones tou A Pagkosmiou Polemou ena koritsaki, e Nel, brisketai egkataleimmeno s' ena ploio gia ten Australia. Mia musteriodes gunaika, e suggrapheas, pou uposkhetheke na ten prosekhei, exaphanisteke khoris n' aphesei ikhne.
Ena tromero mustiko...
To bradu ton genethlion tes, otan ekleise ta eikosi ena, e Nel mathainei ena mustiko pou th' allaxei te zoe tes gia panta. Polu argotera, xekinaei ena taxidi gia na brei ten aletheia, pou ten odegei stis anemodarmenes aktes tes Kornouales kai s' ena arkhontiko pou aneke kapote sten aristokratike oikogeneia Maountraset.
Mia musteriodes kleronomia...
Otan pethainei e Nel, e eggone tes e Kassandra dekhetai mia aprosdokete kleronomia. To Kliph Kotatz ki o xekhasmenos tou kepos einai periboeta stous ntopious tes Kornouales gia ta mustika pou kruboun. Mustika gia ten kataramene oikogeneia Maountraset kai ten prostateuomene tous Elaiza, mia suggraphea skoteinon biktorianon paramuthion. Ekei e Kassandra th' anakalupsei telika ten aletheia gia ten oikogeneia Maountraset kai tha lusei to palio mustiko enos mikrou egkataleimmenou paidiou."æ
ãSe mia mikre pole tes dutikes Nigerias tessera neara adelphia -o mikroteros einai ennia kai o megaluteros dekapente- ekmetalleuontai ten apousia tou patera tous apo to spiti gia na pane gia psarema sto apagoreumeno kontino potami. Ekei tha sunantesoun enan epikinduno trelo pou tha propheteusei oti o megaluteros adelphos tha dolophonethei apo ena apo ta adelphia tou. Aute e propheteia tha stathei e aphorme na dialuthei o iskhuros desmos tous kai e apheteria mias alusidas tragikon gegonoton skhedon muthikon diastaseon.
Mia istoria agapes, misous kai ekdikeses pou diadramatizetai me phonto tis koinonikopolitikes exelixeis ste Nigeria tes dekaetias tou '90. Mia sugklonistike aphegese me te phone tou mikroterou adelphou, tou Mpentzamin, kai exairetike khrese tes glossas. Anaphores sten aphrikanike phuse, stous muthous kai tis doxasies tes Nigerias, katagraphe tes kathemerinotetas me kurio axona te sugkrouse metaxu paradosiakou kai dutikou tropou zoes, se ena exokho proto biblio enos logotekhne pou axiopoiei me monterno tropo ten aphrikanike aphegematike paradose kai phainetai na ekhei makra kariera mprosta tou."ì
éTo "Animal" isos sas thumisei ena apo ta biblia tes Agkatha Kristi. E kai polla mazi. Mila gia kleronomous sto anoigma mias diathekes, kleronomous pou misoun o enas ton allo, kai pou anamesa tous brisketai mia athoa, aponereute parateretria: e Mpeatris Phragkonar.
Ki akome mila gia mia khionothuella, pou apokleiei olous autous tous anthropous sto idio spiti. To kako phusika den argei na sumbei. Enas-enas oi kalesmenoi arkhizoun na apodemoun. Ta ptomata auxanontai, oi upoptoi ligosteuoun. Omos anamesa tous uparkhei ki ena allo kako, aorato. E eroida einai e mone pou isos mporei na anakalupsei ton enokho. Eseis;"ô	
ñ	Oslo, 1969. Otan o Magkntalon Selnteroup, poluekatommurioukhos kai proen melos tes Antistases, soriazetai nekros kata te diarkeia enos souare, o epitheoretes Kolmpiorn Kristiansen, gnostos kai os K2, menei anaudos. O logos; To thuma eikhe epikoinonesei mazi tou molis ten proegoumene mera ekphrazontas phobous gia te zoe tou.
Suntoma, ginetai olophanero oti kai oi deka kalesmenoi sto deipno tou Selnteroup mporoun na theorethoun upoptoi. Polloi apo tous oikeious tou eklipontos ton apekhthanontan e ton misousan? e de prosphate diatheke tou isos purodotesei polles kai sobares antidraseis. Omos poios apo tous kalesmenous -apo ten proen kai te nun suzugo kai ta tria paidia tou eos te goeteutike grammatea kai tous palious suntrophous tou sten Antistase- eikhe to iskhurotero kinetro gia phono;
Me ten anektimete boetheia tes Patrisia -mias euphuestates, phlegmatikes neares gunaikas, pou zei mia periorismene kat' oikon zoe sten anaperike karekla tes-, o K2 arkhizei na xemplekei ton isto ton psematon se kathemia apo tis katatheseis ton kalesmenon. Kathos, omos, e astunomia lambanei to ena musteriodes gramma meta to allo, me proeidopoieseis gia thanatous pou epontai, o K2 suneidetopoiei oti prepei na apoduthei se agona dromou gia na xeskepasei ton dolophono."ú
÷E Astunomia khreiazetai ton Khari Khole giati enas dolophonos trigurna stous dromous tou Oslo kai dolophonei astunomikous. Sugkekrimena ta thumata briskontai se topous egklematon pou den katapheran na exikhniasoun. Oi phonoi einai biaioi kai e antidrase ton MME usterike. O aionios Khari, ntetektib apo te phuse tou, ekhei emplakei se oles tis semantikes ereunes egklematon ton teleutaion khronon sto Oslo. Me ten polu prosopike tou aisthese dikaiosunes na ton kathodegei, pistos se o,ti agapa kai apophasismenos na to uperaspistei, aute te phora moiazei khamenos kai anemporos. Arage tha ta katapherei na xeperasei gia alle mia phora ton eauto tou kathos to nauagio tes prosopikes tou zoes ton ekhei buthisei ston pato.
KRITIKES
O Nesbo kataphere na demiourgesei mia poluepipede istoria pou tha sas parei to mualo. To pos koruphonei to saspens tha didasketai sto mellon se seminaria demiourgikes graphes... Adeiaste to programma sas, kathiste anapautika kai apolauste oles tis anatropes kai tis ekplexeis pou sas epiphulassei o basilias tes sugkhrones astunomikes logotekhnias.
Sunday Express
Den uparkhoun pio sunarpastika, pio entona kai pio skoteina astunomika thriler ste skandinabike skhole astunomikes logotekhnias apo ta biblia tes seiras Khari Khole. E dekate peripeteia tou Khole einai to kalutero biblio tes seiras mekhri semera.
Sunday Mirror
Ethistiko... Sto stil tou sirial Breaking Bad.
Chicago Tribune
Diaphthora, narkotika, sophronistike politike kai "anorthodoxes" methodoi tes astunomias mplekontai me akraies sumperiphores se ena biblio tou opoiou e anagnose moiazei me bolta me to trenaki tou tromou. Sou kobei ten anasa.
Boston Globe"ı
úTi sumbainei otan e metroteta den einai mia oneiremene empeiria;
Pos niothei mia metera apenanti ston gio tes ton dolophono;
Poies einai oi euthunes tes;
Egklematias genniesai e ginesai;
E Iba pote den ethele pragmatika na ginei metera. Sigoura den ethele na ginei e metera enos psukhrou agoriou pou dolophonese ephta summathetes tou, enan upallelo tes skholikes kantinas kai mia demophile kathegetria tou liges meres prin kleisei ta dekaxi.
Duo khronia meta ta tragika gegonota, erthe e ora e Iba na analusei me eilikrineia ton gamo, ten kariera tes, ten oikogeneia tes, te skhese tes me ta paidia tes, to phoniko xespasma tou Kebin se mia seira apo aphoplistika exomologetikes epistoles pou apeuthunontai ston khameno suzugo tes, ton Phranklin.
Aphupnistiko kai prokletiko, to muthistorema auto agapetheke apo ekatommuria anagnostes se oloklero ton kosmo kai prokalese thuella suzeteseon."€
ıO kurios Pernti einai "logotekhnikos pharmakopoios". Sto ploto bibliopoleio tou, stis okhthes tou Sekouana, suntagographei muthistoremata gia kathe duskolia tes zoes -proteinei stous pelates tou biblia pou tha giatrepsoun tis psukhes tous.
Ton mono pou den mporei na giatrepsei einai ton eauto tou aphou exakolouthei na ton stoikheionei to phantasma tes megales tou agapes pou exaphanisteke prin apo eikosi ena khronia, aphenontas piso tes mono ena gramma. Ena gramma pou ekeinos den anoixe pote.
Auto to kalokairi o kurios Pernti mpainei epitelous ston peirasmo na diabasei to gramma -kai tote ta panta allazoun.
Sekonei agkura kai pheugei gia ton noto tes Gallias. Me suntaxidiotes enan diasemo suggraphea pou ekhei khasei ten empneuse tou ki enan erotokhtupemeno seph, tha kanei ena taxidi sten kardia tes Probegkias. Ena taxidi piso stis anamneseis, ki apo ekei xana ste zoe...
E Nina Gkeorgke me sageneutike graphe mas dinei mia glukia kai sugkhronos diaskedastike istoria gemate euaisthesia, pou tha sas sunarpasei."␀␀`@"␀␀p@"	
